      ],
      "image": "assets/images/168244/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease the bottom of a 9x11-inch baking dish with cooking spray.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat a large skillet over medium-high heat. Cook and stir sausage in the hot skillet until browned and crumbly, 5 to 7 minutes. Drain and discard grease. Stir in cream cheese until combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/r87cexxsawpXbGxAurtbIghmXoI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/168244-Simple-Sausage-Casserole-DDMFS-024-step3-21602e6058ad493992446559bbf53ab7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/168244/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll crescent roll dough from 1 can into the bottom of the prepared baking dish without separating. Bake in the preheated oven for 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nRuPnRj9M0mz10QnaTn0uwUyVpU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/168244-Simple-Sausage-Casserole-DDMFS-026-step5-fcee429c0e5c43b390bb8b529c45516c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/168244/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread sausage mixture over baked crescent rolls; top with crescent roll dough from remaining can.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ftOmxnBFxJ-yz-BtfkISluFaBVI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/168244-Simple-Sausage-Casserole-DDMFS-028-step7-f7177f2329c8460e8d6b47bc138efc72.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/168244/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Continue baking until the top layer is golden brown, about 8 minutes.",
      "section": null,
